>Another spoiler:  find an
>altar to your god and dump armor and weapons on it BEFORE using them -
>they'll be uncursed and you'll be able to take them off if they are bad.

False.

Dropping items on an altar of any type (your god or not) will tell you if
it's cursed, uncursed, or blessed.  It won't _change_ whether it's cursed,
uncursed, or blessed, it will just make it _known_.

Exception: water, which becomes holy, normal, or unholy water depending on
what altar it's dropped.
